#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:243
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <option>-DENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</option> option is used, the "
"documentation is not rebuilt nor installed now.  If you need the "
"documentation, you can either install <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> and remove"
" this option from the <command>cmake</command> command, or install the pre-"
"built documentation instead:"
msgstr ""
"Como a opção &quot;<option>-DENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</option>&quot; é "
"usada, a documentação não é reconstruída nem instalada agora. Se precisar da"
" documentação, [então] você pode, ou instalar o &quot;<xref linkend='gi-"
"docgen'/>&quot; e remover essa opção do comando "
"&quot;<command>cmake</command>&quot;, ou instalar a documentação pré "
"construída:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:250
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /usr/share/gtk-doc/html/{jsc-glib,webkit2gtk{,-web-extension}}-4.1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -vm644  ../Documentation/jsc-glib-4.1/*              \\\n"
"                /usr/share/gtk-doc/html/jsc-glib-4.1         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -vm644  ../Documentation/webkit2gtk-4.1/*            \\\n"
"                /usr/share/gtk-doc/html/webkit2gtk-4.1       &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -vm644  ../Documentation/webkit2gtk-web-extension-4.1/* \\\n"
"                /usr/share/gtk-doc/html/webkit2gtk-web-extension-4.1</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /usr/share/gtk-doc/html/{jsc-glib,webkit2gtk{,-web-extension}}-4.1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -vm644  ../Documentation/jsc-glib-4.1/*               \\\n"
